sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as React App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as Database

    Note over U,DB: PHASE 1 - Generate Invoice
    U->>FE: click Generate Invoice on confirmed order
    FE->>API: POST /api/invoices (order_id)
    API->>DB: check order status = confirmed
    API->>DB: check no existing invoice for order
    API->>DB: INSERT invoice (status=draft)
    API-->>FE: 201 Invoice created
    FE-->>U: show invoice preview

    Note over U,DB: PHASE 2 - Record Payment
    U->>FE: enter payment amount
    FE->>API: PATCH /api/invoices/id/payment
    API->>DB: get invoice total and paid_amount

    alt fully paid
        API->>DB: UPDATE status=paid
    else partial payment
        API->>DB: UPDATE paid_amount, status=sent
    end

    API-->>FE: 200 Payment recorded
    FE-->>U: show updated status
